 "_doc": "Tyche, god (GAME_DESIGN.md: Gods; art 10/31/2026). Built by tools/art/build_god_tyche.py; rules in docs/ART_RULES.md. Goddess of fortune: Hesiod, Theogony 360 (a daughter of Ocean); Pindar, Olympian 12 (Tyche the Saviour, who steers swift ships at sea). As Hellenistic statues show her (the Tyche of Antioch by Eutychides, and later copies): a crown shaped like a city's walls and towers, a long chiton with a mantle draped round her, the cornucopia (horn of plenty) in one arm and the ship's steering oar in her hand.",
